OL,3,AThe Celebrity Traitors connections that
OL,4,Amight surprise you
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis words sum up the key difference
OL,7,Fbetween this series and the regular
OL,8,Fcivilian version. In Celebrity
OL,9,FTraitors, the players aren't just
OL,10,Fon-screen competitors - many actually
OL,11,Fknow each other outside the show.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/19
