OL,3,AAlison Hammond returns home from
OL,4,Ahospital after rushing off This Morning
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlison Hammond has said she is home and
OL,7,F"feeling so much better" after she went
OL,8,Fto hospital for a heart check-up after
OL,9,Fleaving ITV's This Morning midway
OL,10,Fthrough Friday's show.
OL,12,FThe presenter, 51, left the programme
OL,13,Fduring its live broadcast, appearing to
OL,14,Fclutch her chest as she was helped off
OL,15,Fset by co-host Dermot O'Leary. He later
OL,16,Ftold viewers she was "feeling a little
OL,17,Funwell".
OL,19,FSoon after Hammond said she had "a
OL,20,Flittle bit of a palpitation" and was
OL,21,Fundergoing tests.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
